+
+**Evidence.** `dev_tools/builtins/`: `extract-builtin-declarations` +
+`print-gcc-builtins.cpp`/`print-clang-builtins.cpp` **scrape signatures from
+installed compiler binaries via their plugin/debug interfaces** (explicitly
