+   `Builtin::Context` via `clang -cc1 -ast-dump` on a file using
+   `__has_builtin`). For lccc, a portable variant: generate probes
+   `void probe(void){ (void)__builtin_foo; }` and parse `gcc/clang -fsyntax-only`
