+# EDG `src/Changes` — C-relevant entries (full text)
+
+Generated by `scripts/edg_changes_mine.py --min-score 2`; 1567 of 13562 entries qualify (both header eras parsed; anchored scoring).  Each entry is a resolved EDG bug with IDs and before/after semantics — read this as a checklist of C implementation edge cases before touching LCCC's frontend, const-eval or layout code.  Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception (edgcpp/compiler); quotes kept verbatim with attribution (third_party_licenses/EDG-Clang-Apache-2.0-LLVM.txt).
