+**Clang compatibility: arguments dropped from __builtin_masked_... calls**
+
+*C-score +2*
+
+```text
+Previously, calls of __builtin_masked_load, __builtin_masked_expand_load, and
+__builtin_masked_gather (see the changes for EDGcpfe/28718 in version 6.9) only
+had their first argument recorded in the IL for the call.  That is now fixed.
