+Version 6.9 of the front end introduced local variables of type a_constant in
+the expr.c source code.  Such local variables lack an IL entry prefix, which
+can result in memory corruption when pointers to the variables are passed to
+various functions.  This has now been fixed (by using local_constant() instead;
