+## 2026-08-18 · `EDGcpfe/29009`
+
+**Clang compatibility: __cpp_runtime_arrays**
+
+*C-score +4*
+
+```text
+The changes for EDGcpfe/28560 in version 6.9 added the feature-test macro
+__cpp_runtime_arrays used by gcc to indicate support for the non-standard
