+## 2025-04-23 · `EDGcpfe/28104`
+
+**C-generating back end: Bit field with explicitly-aligned typedef types**
+
+*C-score +9*
+
+```text
+Consider, e.g., in GNU C mode:
+
+  #include <stdio.h>
+  typedef int PI __attribute__((aligned(1)));
+  struct S {
+    char c;
+    PI x : 25;
+  } s[2];
+  char* byte(int n) { return (char*)&s[n]; }
