+  #pragma weak weak_func
+  int weak_func(int p);
+  int main() {
+    if (weak_func != 0) {
+      printf("Error.\n");
+    } else {
+      printf("Okay.\n");
+    }
+  }
+
+Previously, this short program output "Error." because constant evaluation
+folded "weak_func != 0" to true.  Now, the comparison is no longer folded and
+run time evaluation selects the "Okay." output.
+```
