+  #define V(...) M(__VA_ARGS__)
+  #define M2(x, y) x + y
+  #define V2(...) M2(__VA_ARGS__)
+  V( , )
+  V2(x, y)
+
+The clang preprocessor with -E -fms-compatibility accepts this example
+without error and produces
+
+  --> , <--
+  x + y
+
+and the front end with -E --clang --ms_compatibility now does so as well.
+By contrast, MSVC and the front end in Microsoft mode warn about too few
+arguments in the invocation of M2 and produce
