+configurations.  For nodes representing operators, it replaces the field
+"operator_position" (which was only defined when EXTRA_SOURCE_POSITIONS_IN_IL
+is TRUE), but for other kinds of nodes that correspond to a construct in the
+source code, it now records the starting position of that construct.
