+```text
+The front end now issues remarks for operations on variables that
+are unsequenced and could therefore result in undefined behavior.
+The algorithm does not detect all instances of unsequenced behavior
+(in particular, it limits the processing to expressions involving
+variables).  The additional processing to detect unsequenced operations
+is only performed when the ec_unsequenced_use_of_variable diagnostic
+is enabled (either by enabling all remarks or by explicitly enabling this
+remark).  The new processing is only available in configurations where
+the new configuration macro SEQUENCING_DIAGNOSTICS_ENABLED is TRUE
