+  struct __attribute__((packed)) S {
+    char c1;
+    int x2:1 __attribute(((aligned(8)));
+    int x3:4;
+  } ;
+
+When configured to match gcc on an IA-32-based Linux, the front end now
+correctly computes the size of S as 16, whereas previously it was 2.
+```
