+terminated with a "bitfield_to_avoid_codecenter_warnings" entry.  This
+entry is now included only if the CENTERLINE_CHECKING macro is also set.
+In addition, this entry had the type "unsigned int:2" but should have been
+"a_bit_field:2".  This resulted in wasted space when compiling the front
+end with Microsoft compilers.  The type of the entry has now been changed
+to "a_bit_field:2".
