+                                // call is treated as a constant.
+
+These functions appear in constant-expressions in the C++ header <limits> of
+GNU C++ version 3.3.  (The built-in pseudo-functions __builtin_constant_p and
+__builtin_classify_type were already evaluated at compile time in previous
+versions of the front end.)
+```
