+by addition of a "!= 0" test if the expression is not guaranteed
+to be a pure 0/1 value already.  This was not done for the generated
+call of __cxa_guard_acquire generated by IL lowering to do locking
+of the initialization of a local static variable in the IA-64 ABI.
