+## 2003-05-06
+
+**C99 real + imaginary: new IL operators**
+
+*C-score +3*
+
+```text
+The mixed real/imaginary add/subtract cases in C99 are now represented
+by specialized expression operators (IL CHANGE):
+
+  eok_fjadd      real      + imaginary
+  eok_jfadd      imaginary + real
+  eok_fjsubtract real      - imaginary
+  eok_jfsubtract imaginary - real
